title: "Not All Attention Is Equal: A Quantitative Survey of the EEI Trade-off"
abstract: >-
  Quantitative survey of efficient attention mechanisms introducing the
  Efficiency--Expressiveness--Interpretability (EEI) framework, a scored
  21-method panel, a perturbation-sensitivity protocol, and a reproducibility
  package.
